        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-24T18:28:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Haven't done this yet, and don't know whether or not I actually will, but it occurs to me that one could 'play' one villain against another villain with no heroes at all, just to see what would happen. Whenever a villain card mentions a hero or hero target, it would refer to all of the targets of the other villain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I wonder if Baron Blade would have a tremendous advantage in this sort of scenario, winning by getting his trash full.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:03.901Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
