        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Haven&#39;t done this yet, and don&#39;t know whether or not I actually will, but it occurs to me that one could &#39;play&#39; one villain against another villain with no heroes at all, just to see what would happen. Whenever a villain card mentions a hero or hero target, it would refer to all of the targets of the other villain.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I wonder if Baron Blade would have a tremendous advantage in this sort of scenario, winning by getting his trash full.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
