      {
        "id": 36578,
        "name": "awp832",
        "username": "awp832",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-24T20:12:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>it would be difficult to pull this off without some kind of smart targeting.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For example, many villains target the villain target with the highest hp, which if facing off against BB, it would be &nbsp;BB. &nbsp; However BB is immune to damage until the platform goes down, making for about a jillion wasted attacks, and making BB pretty good in this situation. &nbsp; Despite this, my money is on Omnitron, &nbsp; Cosmic Powered Exterminator/ Sentient Dropship. &nbsp; Electropulse explosive is too powerful for most villains to stop.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:10:27.459Z",
